## Session file redirections: `>` / `>>` / `<` → Shell.runIo (PATH commands).
## Output path under /tmp so the suite does not leave tree artifacts.
echo hello > /tmp/thoxa_session_redir_out.txt
cat /tmp/thoxa_session_redir_out.txt
echo world >> /tmp/thoxa_session_redir_out.txt
cat < /tmp/thoxa_session_redir_out.txt
